+/**
+ * Settled occupancy per click state, in slide coordinates, shared by every
+ * annotation on the slide. Slides are temporal: a label placed at click 1 and
+ * visible through click 3 must clear the content of all three states, so a
+ * snapshot of each presented click is kept once its animations settle. This
+ * is the incremental strategy of the placement specification: a state that
+ * has not been presented yet cannot be known, so a persistent label is
+ * validated against every state collected so far and re-planned when a newly
+ * presented state conflicts — no-overlap is preserved, at the documented cost
+ * that a label cannot promise to never move. Coordinates are the slide's own,
+ * so the snapshots survive window resizes and presentation scaling.
+ */
